#: ../index.md:7 006289de7dbc4d02aa9314a60c7d6330
msgid "QTrade"
msgstr "QTrade"

#: ../index.md:9 1504ed90c6194901a1fa39bfeb2433cc
msgid ""
"QTrade is a simple, modular, and highly customizable trading interface "
"capable of handling backtesting, reinforcement learning tasks."
msgstr ""
"QTrade 是一个简洁、模块化、高度可定制的交易框架，支持回测和强化学习任务。"

#: ../index.md:11 872651388c554f4a9740ea082ba562fc
msgid ""
"With features ranging from traditional signal-based strategies to "
"reinforcement learning-driven approaches, QTrade allows traders to focus "
"on developing and testing strategies without the burden of implementation"
" details."
msgstr ""
"涵盖传统信号策略到强化学习驱动的方法，QTrade 让交易者专注于策略开发与测试，"
"而不必纠结于底层实现细节。"

#: ../index.md:13 9bb0d47713ec484aa2fd305d899a0335
msgid "Key Features"
msgstr "核心功能"

#: ../index.md:14 818accccc7ed4b6dae64473f5059349b
msgid ""
"**Backtesting**: Single-asset or multi-asset / portfolio strategies with "
"shared cash and per-asset positions."
msgstr ""
"**回测**：支持单资产或多资产 / 投资组合策略，共享现金池、各资产独立持仓。"

#: ../index.md:15 78cb9e0136a94c48886b7fe4b5e18aac
msgid ""
"**Reinforcement Learning**: A highly customizable Gymnasium environment "
"for training and testing AI-driven trading agents."
msgstr ""
"**强化学习**：内置高度可定制的 Gymnasium 环境，用于训练和测试 AI 驱动的交易智能体。"

#: ../index.md:59 8ab31897b3a742738a6c95a1e55120b6
msgid "How to Use"
msgstr "如何使用"

#: ../index.md:61 812917b647834fb393d1a374ea544d9c
msgid ""
"**Install QTrade** Follow the instructions in the [Installation "
"Guide](#installation) to set up QTrade in your Python environment."
msgstr ""
"**安装 QTrade** 按照[安装指南](#installation)在你的 Python 环境中安装 QTrade。"

#: ../index.md:64 01102a5b91714856a2944330510ba4b7
msgid ""
"**Explore Tutorials** Learn to create strategies, backtest them, and use "
"gym trading environment by following the [Getting "
"Started](guide/getting_started.md) and the [Trading "
"Environment](guide/trading_environment.md)."
msgstr ""
"**浏览教程** 阅读[快速开始](guide/getting_started.md)和[交易环境]"
"(guide/trading_environment.md)，学习如何编写策略、运行回测和使用 Gym 交易环境。"

#: ../index.md:67 28c82b9ccb3a4ba1a4a57fa9e2ec33e9
msgid ""
"**API Reference** Dive deeper into QTrade's core components with the [API"
" Reference](api/core.md)."
msgstr ""
"**API 参考** 通过 [API 参考](api/core.md)深入了解 QTrade 的核心组件。"

